title: 9 - Mystery Box

cover_description: The title text with a faint white glow behind it. It and the song's code is overlaid on an orange and black glowy scene

cover: cover.jpg

-- synopsis
It took me until now to discover that you can loop things across cycles with `{7 0 -7}%16`, and it just goes. Could have used that in some shows.

(Go back to the album Downloads for the Strudel code).
